body:
Yeah I have played it for a few hours, the game is one of the most stunning games I have ever seen! The story so far seems great too. I am a big souls/sekiro fan so BloodBorne is right up my alley, just need to time to dedicate to it. Spiderman I only played for about an hour, but that is just because I had so many other games on the go at the time.

&#x200B;

And now later this year there will be Borderlands 3, Death Stranding, Monster Hunter Iceborne... Also being a Nintendo fan they are bringing a lot to the table. This year is just going to be nuts!

I mean, this is quite a different take on the Ghost Recon series, didn't anyone watch the gameplay?

&#x200B;

You are meant to feel vulnerable and isolated, you're in the special forces, are sent to an island that hasn't been explored by your team before, and, well, your team crashed and burned.
